  "description": "Model of a Paper Mate Kilometrico ballpoint pen. Modeled to real world scale with blue, red and black textures. 3 different diffuse maps, metallic, roughness and normal maps included. Note that the normal map has bevel baked in. Subdivision ready, I recomend using the FBX version. Material made using Cycles, make sure if using Eevee to double check you material settings if your getting weird face transparency! (by default its set to alpha blend, not opaque).",
